# Generated test-run artifacts under docs/reports/*-artifacts/.
# Covers the per-run harness output set (run.log, targets.txt, exit-code.txt,
# metadata.json, selected-tests.json) and the trace dumps. Hand-written content
# in those dirs stays tracked: README.md, manifest.json, the *-report-table.md
# notes, and the *.cpp probe/benchmark sources.
docs/reports/*-artifacts/**/*.trace
docs/reports/*-artifacts/**/*.log
docs/reports/*-artifacts/**/*.txt
docs/reports/*-artifacts/**/metadata.json
docs/reports/*-artifacts/**/*.metadata.json
docs/reports/*-artifacts/**/selected-tests.json

# A06a: per-run producer/install/consumer trees from verify-consumer-package.sh
build-consumer-verify/
